  "key_API_dictionary": {
    "owned_PairedAlphaDeletion": "No theorem from the unowned SharedFirstFactorDispersion is imported. Its owned sole parent already owns the finite Nat.ext_div_modEq quotient-block method and transposed carrier dictionary.",
    "Nat.ModEq.cancel_right_of_coprime": "Native ModEq.lean:416: gcd p g=1 -> a*g congruent b*g mod p -> a congruent b mod p. We supply actual g.Coprime p.symm, before cancellation.",
    "Finset.card_le_card_of_injOn": "Card.lean:427. Both quotient maps have explicit membership and injectivity proofs.",
    "Finset.sum_Icc_sub": "Additive theorem generated by @[to_additive] Intervals.lean:236 prod_Icc_div; used on real inverses for the finite telescope.",
    "harmonic_floor_le_one_add_log": "Bounds.lean:71: 1<=T -> harmonic floorT <=1+logT. First harmonic identity uses harmonic_eq_sum_Icc with casts."
  },
  "mathematical_scope": [
    "Any p>0, including every composite factor; no primality or gamma1 active-support assumption.",
    "Source pairs retain BOTH unit conditions n1.Coprime p,n2.Coprime p, shared Nat.ModEq p n1 n2, and true gcd cutoff Y<gcd(n1,n2). All ordered and diagonal pairs retained.",
    "Actual gcd g is positive, <=floorT and coprime p, proved from source pair before quotient cancellation. Enlarged divisor union retains g.Coprime p.",
    "Injection z->(z1,z2/p) gives reduced congruence count <=K*(K/p+1); z->(z1/g,z2/g) uses actual divisibility and g.Coprime p.",
    "Tail compare inv(g)^2 <=2*(inv(g)-inv(g+1)) for g>=1. Sum g>Y starts at floorY+1>Y, bounds <=2/Y. No replacement of strict real cutoff by g>=Y.",
    "Harmonic term <=1+logT pays the complete diagonal contribution. Finite endpoint card<=2T^2/(pY)+T(1+logT), T,Y>=1 and N subset positive interval.",
    "Actual original-U instance uses entire transposed beta carrier=factorCarrier U with hU>=1, yielding8U^2/(pY)+2U*(1+log(2U)); original alpha interval zero padding is not altered.",
    "No W/Fourier/zero budget/moving-a error theorem, no clean-alpha hypothesis, no already-paid energy or full target claim."
  ],
  "no_Lean_or_build_invocation": true
